{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24297","headline":"自咏 · 白居易","name":"自咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"细故随缘尽，衰形具体微。\n鬬闲僧尚闹，较瘦鹤犹肥。\n老遣宽裁袜，寒教厚絮衣。\n马从衔草展，鸡任啄笼飞。\n只要天和在，无令物性违。\n自余君莫问，何是复何非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}